## Evaluation Instructions

1. Read the evidence data carefully
2. Determine if the control requirement is met
3. Consider partial compliance (e.g., MFA enforced for 8/12 users = partially compliant = non-compliant)
4. If evidence is insufficient to determine, mark as NOT_TESTED
5. If the control does not apply to this target, mark as NOT_APPLICABLE

## Output Format

You MUST output a JSON object with the following fields:

```json
{
  "control_id": "{{ control_id }}",
  "status": "compliant | non-compliant | not-applicable | not-tested",
  "evidence_summary": "Brief summary of what was found",
  "severity": "{{ severity }}",
  "confidence": "high | medium | low",
  "details": ["List of specific non-compliant items found"],
  "justification": "Why this status was chosen"
}
```